  "method": "Actual sample-free FM Synth 0.1.2-experimental playback through Mini Verb 0.2.1-experimental in Octemu, with a browser-composed private OS 1.40C image. VECTOR 0.2.4 engine.c runs offline to supply note positions and semitone pitches, transferred through FM held-trig parameter locks; VECTOR does not run directly on the FM machine. The stock native sequencer runs the 16-step phrase at 128 BPM. INDX 44–92 and FDBK 0–28 sweep together over 7.5 seconds of requested guest-clock time. Trim boot/edit silence, retain the musical phrase and stopped tail, add 5/35 ms end fades, apply one common gain, and encode without a limiter. Not a physical Octatrack recording.",
